msgid ""
"SGLang-Diffusion supports MXFP8 online and offline quantization for "
"diffusion models (such as Wan2.2) on Ascend NPUs. MXFP8 requires A5; the "
"ModelSlim W8A8/W4A4 schemes work on A2/A3."
