#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:74
msgid "Online MXFP8 Quantization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:76
msgid ""
"Online quantization dynamically quantizes FP16/BF16 weights to MXFP8 at load "
"time using `npu_dynamic_mx_quant` + `npu_quant_matmul` CANN kernels. Pass `--"
"quantization mxfp8` to override auto-detection."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:78
msgid ""
"# Start the diffusion server with online MXFP8 quantization\n"
"sglang serve \\\n"
"  --model-path Wan-AI/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-Diffusers \\\n"
"  --quantization mxfp8 \\\n"
"  --num-gpus 4\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:86
msgid ""
"# One-shot generation\n"
"sglang generate \\\n"
"  --model-path Wan-AI/Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-Diffusers \\\n"
"  --quantization mxfp8 \\\n"
"  --prompt \"a beautiful sunset over the mountains\" \\\n"
"  --save-output\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:95
msgid "Offline MXFP8 Quantization (ModelSlim)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:97
msgid ""
"For offline quantization, pre-quantize the model with msModelSlim and load "
"the resulting checkpoint. The quantization scheme is auto-detected from "
"`quant_model_description.json`, so no extra `--quantization` flag is needed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:99
msgid "**Step 1: Quantize with msModelSlim**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:101
msgid ""
"msmodelslim quant \\\n"
"  --model_path /path/to/wan2_2_float_weights \\\n"
"  --save_path /path/to/wan2_2_mxfp8_weights \\\n"
"  --device npu \\\n"
"  --model_type Wan2_2 \\\n"
"  --quant_type mxfp8 \\\n"
"  --trust_remote_code True\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:111
msgid ""
"Note: SGLang does not support quantized embeddings; disable embedding "
"quantization when using msmodelslim."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:113
msgid "**Step 2: Convert to Diffusers format**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:115
msgid ""
"msModelSlim saves quantized Wan2.2 weights in the original Wan format. "
"Convert to Diffusers format using the provided repack script:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:117
msgid ""
"python python/sglang/multimodal_gen/tools/wan_repack.py \\\n"
"  --input-path /path/to/wan2_2_mxfp8_weights \\\n"
"  --output-path /path/to/wan2_2_mxfp8_diffusers\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:123
msgid ""
"Then copy all files from the original Diffusers checkpoint (except the "
"`transformer`/`transformer_2` folders) into the output directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:125
msgid "**Step 3: Run inference**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:127
msgid ""
"sglang generate \\\n"
"  --model-path /path/to/wan2_2_mxfp8_diffusers \\\n"
"  --prompt \"a beautiful sunset over the mountains\" \\\n"
"  --save-output\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/ascend/ascend_npu_quantization.md:134
msgid ""
